ADDITIONAL NOTE ON AGRICULTURAL CONTENT

The disease treatments, pesticide recommendations and fertilizer dosages in
this repository are compiled from published agricultural extension sources.
They have NOT been reviewed by a qualified agronomist. Incorrect chemical
advice can destroy a crop and endanger the person applying it. Do not use this
content to guide real agricultural decisions without expert review.
